        "id": "branch",
        "title": "The branch: if / else if / else with && or ||",
        "description": "Full credit 8: a full chain resolving the problem's decision, at least one compound condition. Partial 5: chain present, conditions all simple. Partial 3: single if/else only. Withhold: no branch.",
